WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Manu understands the screen, the role and the permitted company context.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:27.000
She explains, retrieves evidence, summarizes signals and prepares thoughtful drafts.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Risky actions remain visible, scoped and under human control.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Permission-aware. Tenant-safe. Evidence-led. Designed for human judgement.
